{
  "loads": true,
  "name": "var-hook",
  "nameSource": "manifest",
  "hooks": {
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Write|Edit",
        "command": "\"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/format.sh\"",
        "args": [],
        "resolvedCommand": "\"/plugins/cache/local/var-hook/1.0.0/scripts/format.sh\"",
        "exportSet": [
          "CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT",
          "CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA",
          "CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR"
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash",
        "command": "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/scripts/audit.sh",
        "args": [
          "--data",
          "${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA}/cache",
          "--project",
          "${CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR}"
        ],
        "resolvedCommand": "/plugins/cache/local/var-hook/1.0.0/scripts/audit.sh",
        "resolvedArgs": [
          "--data",
          "~/.claude/plugins/data/var-hook/cache",
          "--project",
          "/workspace"
        ],
        "exportSet": [
          "CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT",
          "CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA",
          "CLAUDE_PROJECT_DIR"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "basis": "PLG:553-557 三个路径变量（ROOT=已装版本绝对路径、DATA=跨更新数据目录、PROJECT=项目根）；PLG:569 hook 的 command 与 args 里处处解析；PLG:583 shell 形式要给 ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT} 套双引号（样本保留引号验证替换是纯文本），exec form 无需引号；PLG:585 不加引号 validate 出 warning；PLG:606/:1066 Windows 上替换出的路径用正斜杠（本样本 installRoot 即正斜杠形）；PLG:559 ROOT 随更新改变，不要把状态写进去",
  "pendingFix": "Min 还没有插件加载器——本样本是给加载器实现的验收规格。加载器落地后：把样本接上真加载器逐条复核 expected、按结果改成端到端断言，再摘掉本标记（PluginCompatTest 同时会放开「没有加载器」的探针断言）。"
}
